  "track.animation.m.aas.s.recompose.explain": "Sau khi composition apply, `SideEffect` gọi `state.update(100f, …)`. Vì 100 khác `animatable.targetValue` (0), cần chạy lại animation.",
  "track.animation.m.aas.ev.recompose": "Recompose với target 100 → SideEffect gọi update()",
  "track.animation.m.aas.s.recomposeSame.title": "Recompose với target 100 như cũ",
